Keep a shared safe as an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to 15.
Place 0 into safe.

The queue is an empty list of whole numbers.
The count is 0.
The head is 0.
For every spot from 0 to 15.
The row is spot divided by 4.
The column is spot modulo 4.
If row is 0 or row is 3 or column is 0 or column is 3.
If item spot of board is 0 and item spot of safe is 0, set item spot of safe to 1, Place spot into queue, add 1 to count.

Repeat while head is less than count.
The node is item head of queue.
Add 1 to head.
The row is node divided by 4.
The column is node modulo 4.
If row is more than 0 and item (node minus 4) of board is 0 and item (node minus 4) of safe is 0, set item (node minus 4) of safe to 1, Place (node minus 4) into queue, add 1 to count.
If row is less than 3 and item (node plus 4) of board is 0 and item (node plus 4) of safe is 0, set item (node plus 4) of safe to 1, Place (node plus 4) into queue, add 1 to count.
If column is more than 0 and item (node minus 1) of board is 0 and item (node minus 1) of safe is 0, set item (node minus 1) of safe to 1, Place (node minus 1) into queue, add 1 to count.
If column is less than 3 and item (node plus 1) of board is 0 and item (node plus 1) of safe is 0, set item (node plus 1) of safe to 1, Place (node plus 1) into queue, add 1 to count.

Keep a shared line as empty text.
To render from spot (a whole number) with last (a whole number).
If spot is more than last, return.
If item spot of board is 1 or item spot of safe is 0, Place "X" into line, otherwise Place "O" into line.
Render from spot plus 1 with last.

For every row from 0 to 3.
Set line to empty text.
The start is row times 4.
The finish is start plus 3.
Render from start with finish.
Show line.
